  "data": {
    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "12. Fight Phase",
    "ruleNumber": "12.06",
    "summary": "This fight type is open to a unit that is [unengaged](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range), or that was [unengaged](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) when the Fight step began and has since become [engaged](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) in this phase. The unit may make one extra [Pile-in move](vsdata:core-rule/pile-in-move) and then fights following [Making Attacks](vsdata:core-rule/making-attacks) (04). The unit must also be eligible to fight in the [Fight Step](vsdata:core-rule/fight-step).",
